%% alt: Writing and reading agent memory. Candidate memories are extracted from conversations and tool results. Each is checked for its source and filtered for sensitive content. It is then written as a new entry, or used to update or delete a contradicted one, in a memory store scoped per user. At the start of each turn, relevant memories are added to the model's working context.
flowchart TB
  C[Conversation and<br/>tool results]:::untrusted -->|extract| X[Candidate memories]:::model
  X --> G{Source checked,<br/>sensitive filtered:<br/>write?}:::control
  G -->|new| S[(Memory store<br/>scoped per user)]:::data
  G -->|contradicts old| U[Update or delete old]:::tool --> S
  S -->|relevant memories,<br/>start of each turn| W[Working context]:::data --> M[Model]:::model
